    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever above 37.4 °C, chills, or rigors; usual chemotherapy tiredness</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Clear rhinorrhea and sore throat; no mouth ulcers, ear pain, or facial pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough; no breathlessness, wheeze, sputum, or hemoptysis</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, or abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dysuria or frequency</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palmar or plantar redness, peeling, or blistering</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Brief cold-triggered tingling of the fingers after oxaliplatin, resolving between doses; no numbness at rest</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>8 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

