    <td>Adenocarcinoma of the sigmoid colon, suspected at presentation, confirmed by colonoscopic biopsy one week later, and staged IIIB (pT3 N1a M0) at resection; mismatch-repair proficient; synthetic modern diagnosis linked to the documented 1775 bowel disorder and its retrospective interpretation as colon cancer</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
